Error [jet.ComptimeFuelExhausted]: Compile-time code ran past its step limit of 2000000 steps
  --> Tests/UI/comptime_step_limit_lowered_stops_a_spin.jet:10:9
    |
 10 | X: #run spin()
    |         ^^^^
 Why: Compile-time code runs under a step limit, 10000000 steps unless its binding sets another, so a runaway loop can't stall the build
 Fix: Split the work so it fits; a binding computed while building raises its own limit above 2000000 with `#StepLimit(n)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0952
